{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 36, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived, I was struck by the country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture. I spent my days exploring bustling cities like Tokyo and Kyoto, marveling at ancient temples and shrines, and sampling delicious local cuisine.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo, where I watched as fishermen expertly filleted fresh sushi-grade fish. I also had the opportunity to try some of the freshest sushi I've ever had at a small restaurant in the market.\n\nIn Kyoto, I visited the stunning Fushimi Inari Shrine, famous for its thousands of vermillion torii gates that form a tunnel up the mountain. The hike to the top was challenging, but the breathtaking views of the city made it well worth the effort.\n\nThroughout my trip, I was impressed by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. From helpful locals who assisted me with directions to friendly restaurant staff who taught me about the local cuisine, everyone I met was eager to share their culture with me. Overall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with lasting memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.026594871655106544}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.11324971169233322}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " was", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -0.47408804297447205}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0015754204941913486}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.00014053787162993103}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0002051381452474743}, {"token": " From", "logprob": -0.0001760566228767857}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0003355178632773459}, {"token": " mome